    "extract": "\"Muteki na Heart\"  is a song by Japanese singer songwriter Mai Kuraki, taken from her third compilation album Mai Kuraki Best 151A: Love & Hope (2014). It was released on August 27, 2014, and served as the theme song to the Japanese animation Case Closed. It was released as a double-A side with \"Stand by You\".",
    "extract_html": "<p>\"<b>Muteki na Heart</b>\"<span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> </span> is a song by Japanese singer songwriter Mai Kuraki, taken from her third compilation album <i>Mai Kuraki Best 151A: Love &amp; Hope</i> (2014). It was released on August 27, 2014, and served as the theme song to the Japanese animation <i>Case Closed</i>. It was released as a double-A side with \"Stand by You\".</p>"
